Package: statusquoscenarios
Title: Analyze and Visualize Atlantis Model Status Quo Scenarios for Puget Sound
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("AM", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "author@example.com")
Description: Provides functions to analyze and visualize outputs from the Atlantis
    Model for Puget Sound (AMPS) under status quo climate scenarios. Includes spatial
    and temporal visualization of Sea State Model (SSM) outputs, biomass heatmaps,
    numbers-at-age and weight-at-age heatmaps, salmon-specific plots, and biomass
    change histograms.
